  "lines": {
   "en": [
    "1 Win orders | Rolling-12m orders +39% (Elec. Americas), +51% (Elec. Global); data-centre orders doubled.",
    "2 Ship | Q3 2026 sales $8.9B (+28%, organic +19%); electrical backlog $20B (+46%).",
    "3 Earn | FY25 segment margins: Elec. Americas 29.9%, Aerospace 23.8%, Elec. Global 19.4%.",
    "4 Reshape | Boyd Thermal ($9.55B, Mar 2026, liquid cooling) in; Mobility out in early 2027.",
    "5 Collect | FY25 OCF $4.5B - capex $0.9B = FCF $3.6B → dividends $1.6B, buybacks $1.9B."
   ],
   "zh": [
    "1 接单 | 滚动 12 个月订单：美洲电气 +39%、全球电气 +51%；数据中心订单翻倍。",
    "2 交付 | 2026年Q3 销售 $89 亿（+28%，有机 +19%）；电气积压订单 $200 亿（+46%）。",
    "3 盈利 | FY25 分部利润率：美洲电气 29.9%、航空航天 23.8%、全球电气 19.4%。",
    "4 重组 | 收购 Boyd Thermal（$95.5 亿，2026年3月，液冷）；出行业务 2027 年初剥离。",
    "5 回款 | FY25 OCF $4.5B - 资本开支 $0.9B = FCF $3.6B → 股息 $1.6B、回购 $1.9B。"
   ]
  },
