 "lead_paragraphs": [
  {
   "label": {
    "en": "CAPITAL RETURNS:",
    "zh": "现金分配："
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "FY12-25 OCF $39.6B less capex $8.6B left **$31.1B FCF**. Dividends **$15.9B (51%)**; buybacks **$11.6B (37%)**; acquisitions **$15.0B** (Cooper 2012, Tripp Lite 2021). Boyd added **$9.55B** in 2026, funded with debt.",
    "zh": "FY12-25 OCF $39.6B 减资本开支 $8.6B，得 **FCF $31.1B**。股息 **$15.9B（51%）**；回购 **$11.6B（37%）**；收购 **$15.0B**（2012 年 Cooper、2021 年 Tripp Lite）。2026 年再以举债收购 Boyd **$95.5 亿**。"
   }
  },
  {
   "label": {
    "en": "NET SHARES:",
    "zh": "净股数变化："
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "Shares rose from 343M (FY11) to 477M (FY13) with the stock-funded Cooper deal, then buybacks cut them to 391M (FY25), **down 18%** from the peak.",
    "zh": "以换股收购 Cooper 后，股数由 FY11 的 343M 增至 FY13 的 477M；之后回购使其降至 FY25 的 391M，较峰值 **减少 18%**。"
   }
  }
 ],
 "commentary": [
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "An industrial that became an AI power supplier.",
    "zh": "从工业公司变成 AI 电力供应商。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Revenue grew from $17.9B (FY20) to $27.4B (FY25) and Q3 2026 sales rose 28%. Data centres now drive orders: data-centre revenue +65% in Q3, orders doubled, backlog $20B.",
    "zh": "营收由 FY20 的 $179 亿增至 FY25 的 $274 亿，2026年Q3 销售增长 28%。数据中心成为订单主要来源：Q3 数据中心收入 +65%，订单翻倍，积压订单 $200 亿。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Margins have stepped up.",
    "zh": "利润率上了台阶。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "EBIT margin rose from 12.5% (FY21) to 19.0% (FY25); Electrical Americas earns ~30%. My model takes the group to 22% by 2030 as Mobility (13% margin) leaves.",
    "zh": "EBIT 利润率由 FY21 的 12.5% 升至 FY25 的 19.0%；美洲电气约 30%。随着利润率 13% 的出行业务剥离，我的模型把整体利润率在 2030 年推到 22%。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Boyd doubles the debt.",
    "zh": "Boyd 让债务翻倍。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "The $9.55B Boyd Thermal deal (liquid cooling) lifted debt from $10.7B to $20.9B and net debt/EBITDA to 2.9x. It deepens data-centre exposure just as the cycle is debated; Morningstar raised its uncertainty rating to High for the same reason. Deleveraging back below 2x will take about two years of FCF.",
    "zh": "$95.5 亿收购 Boyd Thermal（液冷）使债务由 $107 亿增至 $209 亿，净债务/EBITDA 升至 2.9 倍。这在数据中心周期存在争议时，进一步加大了相关敞口；Morningstar 也因此把不确定性评级上调为 High。把杠杆降回 2 倍以下大约需要两年的 FCF。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Cash returns are balanced.",
    "zh": "现金分配均衡。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "FY25 FCF $3.6B covered dividends ($1.6B) and buybacks ($1.9B). Capex stays near 3% of sales, so most earnings convert to cash; FCF was 87% of net income.",
    "zh": "FY25 FCF $3.6B 覆盖了股息（$1.6B）和回购（$1.9B）。资本开支保持在销售的 3% 左右，利润大多能转化为现金；FCF 为净利润的 87%。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Mobility leaves in 2027.",
    "zh": "出行业务 2027 年离开。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "The split-off removes 11% of sales at a 13% margin. I value Mobility at $4.7B (~7x EBITDA) in the equity bridge, so the DCF covers only the electrical and aerospace business. Without it, the group is ~89% electrical and aerospace, a cleaner but more cyclical mix.",
    "zh": "剥离将移除 11% 的销售，利润率 13%。我在股权价值中按 $47 亿（约 7 倍 EBITDA）计入出行业务，因此 DCF 只覆盖电气与航空航天业务。剥离后公司约 89% 为电气与航空航天，业务更集中，但周期性更强。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "My DCF is below Morningstar and the Street.",
    "zh": "我的 DCF 低于 Morningstar 和华尔街。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Base $240.02 (WACC 9.6%, g 3%, beta 1.14) needs $44.9B sales by 2030 (10.4% a year) at a 22.1% EBIT margin; TV is 78% of EV. At $336.88 that is -29%. Morningstar ($333) uses an 8.5% WACC and a 20-year horizon; at that WACC my model gives ~$296. The data-centre delay case is $214.",
    "zh": "基准价值 $240.02（WACC 9.6%，g 3%，beta 1.14）要求 2030 年销售 $449 亿（年增 10.4%）、EBIT 利润率 22.1%；终值占 EV 78%。按 $336.88 计为 -29%。Morningstar（$333）用 8.5% 的 WACC 和 20 年预测期；按该 WACC 我的模型约 $296。数据中心延期情景为 $214。"
   }
  }
 ],
