   "FY11-25 from SEC 10-K XBRL (Eaton Corp plc; FY11-12 = Eaton before Cooper). Op. income FY20 = pre-tax + interest; FY21-25 = S&P EBIT (analyst model). SBC not tagged in XBRL (--).",
   "EBITDA* = op. income + D&A. FCF = OCF - capex. ROIC* = op. income x (1-21%) / (equity + debt - cash). Dividend/Sh.* = dividends paid / diluted shares. Segment margins from the 10-K segment note.",
   "Header: Nov 16, 2026 close $336.88, 388.5M shares; book value = Sep 30, 2026 equity $21.0B; TTM P/E (EPS $10.01); P/FCF on TTM FCF $3.8B. FY21-25 P/E, yields and Mkt cap* from StockAnalysis (FY-end).",
   "DCF: Pythia model ETN_DCF_Model, Nov 17, 2026; WACC 9.6%, g 3.0%. Morningstar FV $333 (Jul 31, 2026). Street avg target = 29-analyst average (S&P Global via StockAnalysis).",
